        [a|] bim model record
    members:
        nextId as a 64 bit integer
        levels as the type of (a cad topology list of an alpha level record)
        journal as the type of (a cad topology list of a 64 bit integer)
        walls as the type of (a cad topology list of a beta wall record)

function an empty bim model:
    execute:
        return @intrinsic("construct", a bim model record, 1 as a 64 bit integer, a cad topology list of an alpha level record, a cad topology list of a 64 bit integer, a cad topology list of a beta wall record)

# A snapshot shares no store with the original: stores are cloned, values
# copied and shared members shared.
function the bim snapshot of {bim model record:modelValue}:
    execute:
        return @intrinsic("construct", a bim model record, modelValue's nextId, the cad clone of modelValue's levels, modelValue's journal, the cad clone of modelValue's walls)
